+--!strict
+-- The Cliffwind dress (armour look, the cliff valkyrie gown): a sky-blue
+-- gown under a blue-steel cuirass with a white stomacher and a white
+-- neckline, a rock-tan belt marking the hip, and a short white cape at the
+-- back. The bodice follows the body; the full skirt is five gores a leg
+-- hung from the thighs, flaring from the hip to the knee, with the back
+-- gores in cloud white so a pale panel runs down the back.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local c = {
+	sky = { 126, 152, 178 },
+	skyShade = { 112, 138, 166 },
